{"title": "Crimson Weapon", "pageid": 28116, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Crimson_Weapon", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Crimson Weapon</b> is a passive feature that adds extra damage to your attacks.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When you make an attack with your off-hand weapon, you can add your <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Score_Modifier\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Score Modifier\">Ability Modifier</a> to the damage of the attack. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the weapons:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-legendary\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Crimson_Mischief\" title=\"Crimson Mischief\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/09/Crimson_Mischief_Item_Icon.png/30px-Crimson_Mischief_Item_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/09/Crimson_Mischief_Item_Icon.png/45px-Crimson_Mischief_Item_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/09/Crimson_Mischief_Item_Icon.png/60px-Crimson_Mischief_Item_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/09/Crimson_Mischief_Item_Icon.png/30px-Crimson_Mischief_Item_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/09/Crimson_Mischief_Item_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Crimson_Mischief\" title=\"Crimson Mischief\">Crimson Mischief</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Orin\" title=\"Orin\">Orin</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Crimson Weapon also applies to attacks made with an off-hand <a href=\"/wiki/Hand_Crossbows\" title=\"Hand Crossbows\">hand crossbow</a>.</li>\n<li>Crimson Weapon does not stack with other sources of <a href=\"/wiki/Two-Weapon_Fighting\" title=\"Two-Weapon Fighting\">Two-Weapon Fighting</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>   <div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ability_score_modifier\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability score modifier\">Ability modifier</a> added to off-hand attacks.</div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714210843\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.034 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.039 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 869/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 7610/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2344/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 115/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.010/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 688955/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   34.874      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   34.874      1 -total\n 54.78%   19.105      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n 43.29%   15.096      1 Template:Passive_sources/format\n 40.65%   14.175      1 Template:MdRarityItem\n 20.63%    7.193      1 Template:Item_icon\n 17.65%    6.154      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 11.39%    3.972      1 Template:PageSeo\n  8.10%    2.826      1 Template:Main_namespace_only\n  7.93%    2.767      1 Template:Page_style\n